'''Purple Vampire’s Axe''' is an [[Trading|untradeable]] [[Unique Weapons|unique]] knife that was awarded to players who finished top 100 on the [[Halloween Event 2024]] Candy Collecting [[Leaderboards|Leaderboard]].

==Appearance==
Purple Vampire’s Axe has the same appearance as [[Vampire's Axe]], but its primary colors were reverted to a similar purple as the [[Candleflame]]. This unique axe has a deep purple hue, reflecting or giving off a sense of mystery and danger. The blade of the axe is meticulously designed, featuring sharp, jagged edges, like the original  [[Vampire's Axe]]. 

==Trivia== 
*This was the first purple trophy ever awarded to players.

